        {
          "id": "f076b891-559d-4c11-967c-025fe139d19c",
          "name": "Update a position",
          "request": {
            "name": "Update a position",
            "description": {
              "content": "Updates an existing role in the system. The parameters are:\n- identifier: Existing role identifier. Can be either the numeric ID or the Role code\n- name: New name of the role (OPTIONAL)\n- description: New description of the role (OPTIONAL)\n- requirements: New requirements of the role (OPTIONAL)\n- active: Role status (OPTIONAL)\n- area_ids: IDs of the new role areas (OPTIONAL)\n- custom_attributes: Custom attributes of the role (OPTIONAL)\n- role_family_id: Role family ID (OPTIONAL)\n\nThe entered values will overwrite the data of the role being edited\n\nIf area_ids does not contain the current ones, they will be removed, leaving only the ones entered.\n\nYou cannot remove the association of an area with a job title that has active jobs.\n\nEste endpoint no requiere permisos especiales.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "roles",
                ":identifier"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "",
                  "key": "identifier",
                  "description": "(Required) - identifier: Existing role identifier. Can be either the numeric ID or the Role code"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "auth": null
          },
          "response": [
